{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21122","headline":"八骏图诗 · 元稹","name":"八骏图诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆满志空阔，将行九州野。\n神驭四来归，天与八骏马。\n龙种无凡性，龙行无暂舍。\n朝辞扶桑底，暮宿崑仑下。\n鼻息吼春雷，蹄声裂寒瓦。\n尾掉沧波黑，汗染白云赭。\n华輈本修密，翠盖尚妍冶。\n御者腕不移，乘者寐不假。\n车无轮扁斵，辔无王良把。\n虽有万骏来，谁是敢骑者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}